         user's request to blend a face, an X, and a treble clef into one mark rather
         than a plain blank square. Outline-only (no fill), rendered via an `Icon`
         composable so it picks up the current theme's tint at display time rather
         than a color baked into the vector itself - `#FF000000` here is just the
         placeholder color `Icon`'s tint overrides. -->
